%% Content Publishing Flow - Service Interaction Sequence
%% Version: 1.0.0
%% Date: 2025-10-27
%% Description: Complete sequence diagram for content publishing workflow

sequenceDiagram
    actor Creator as Creator
    participant WebApp as Web Application
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware
    participant ContentPub as Content Publishing Service
    participant ContentMod as Content Moderation Service
    participant ContentVer as Content Versioning Service
    participant Repo as Repository Factory
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant EventBus as Event Bus Service
    participant Nostr as NOSTR Relays
    participant Cache as Cache Service
    participant Analytics as Content Analytics Service
    participant Notification as Notification Service

    Creator->>WebApp: Create/Edit Content
    WebApp->>API: POST /api/content/publish
    API->>Auth: Validate JWT + NOSTR Key
    Auth-->>API: Authentication Success

    API->>ContentPub: publishContent(data)

    Note over ContentPub: Validate content structure
    ContentPub->>ContentMod: moderateContent(data)
    ContentMod-->>ContentPub: Moderation Result (approved/flagged)

    alt Content Approved
        ContentPub->>ContentVer: createVersion(content)
        ContentVer->>Repo: saveVersion()
        Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO content_versions
        DB-->>Repo: Version Created
        Repo-->>ContentVer: Version ID
        ContentVer-->>ContentPub: Version Created

        ContentPub->>Repo: saveContent()
        Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO content
        DB-->>Repo: Content ID
        Repo-->>ContentPub: Content Saved

        ContentPub->>Nostr: publishEvent(kind: 1)
        Nostr-->>ContentPub: Event Published

        ContentPub->>EventBus: publish('content.published', data)
        EventBus->>Analytics: handleContentPublished(data)
        EventBus->>Notification: notifyFollowers(data)
        EventBus->>Cache: invalidate(creator_content_*)

        ContentPub-->>API: Success Response
        API-->>WebApp: 201 Created
        WebApp-->>Creator: Content Published Successfully

        Analytics->>Repo: incrementPublishCount()
        Repo->>DB: UPDATE creator_metrics
        Notification->>Repo: getFollowers(creatorId)
        Repo->>DB: SELECT FROM relationships
        DB-->>Repo: Follower List
        Notification->>EventBus: publish('notification.created')

    else Content Flagged
        ContentMod->>Repo: saveFlag()
        Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO moderation_flags
        ContentPub-->>API: 422 Content Flagged
        API-->>WebApp: Moderation Required
        WebApp-->>Creator: Content Requires Review
    end

    Note over Creator,Notification: Content successfully published<br/>to database, NOSTR, and followers notified
